<title>USA: Alabama Housing Finance won by Sterne Agee.</title>
<headline>Alabama Housing Finance won by Sterne Agee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne Agee said it won $75 million of Alabama Housing Finance Authority single-family mortgage revenue bonds, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.974 percent.</p>
</text>
